SUMMARY:Rose of Nevada
DTSTART:20260708T233000Z
DTEND:20260709T014000Z
DTSTAMP:20260708T233000Z
UID:yfuTXbs7xE
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 114 mins (1h54m)\n\n30 years ago\, the Rose of Nevad
 a disappeared at sea. Now\, it has returned. Desperate to make ends meet\,
  two men join its crew and set sail once again\, but soon discover they’
 ve been transported back into the past\, where they are mistaken for the o
 riginal crew.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/rose-of-nevada\n\
 nEstimated start: 16:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
